==Notes==
* The razors seen on the armor icon are totally different from the one on the armor once equipped, indicating that possibly that design was discarded but they forgot to change the icon.
* This armor is labeled Imperial Ascended Armor in the [["Resilience"]] monument in the [[Hall of Monuments]].
* The guise is not the same length on both arms so if you combine with other armor there may be a hole by the elbow.
* The [[Assassin Asuran armor|Asuran armor]] for assassin is the reskin of this armor.
* The spikes on arms will clip through some shields.

